{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中國香港代表團在第五屆亞洲殘疾人運動會硬地滾球項目增添兩塊銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港隊陳柏麟、龍子健及楊曉林出戰混合BC1/BC2級團體賽，以7：5擊敗韓國隊，獲得銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n在混合BC3級雙人賽，港隊謝德樺及陳可欣，以3：2擊敗泰國，摘下銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul><h2>亞殘運硬地滾球項目 港隊添兩面銅牌</h2><p>2026-10-24 HKT 11:51</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:24:26.806899+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:51:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T18:38:28.191672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T04:18:25.365121+00:00","content_hash":"950f30f5841b86755078e86bfaefed05929a5bb70c4f423f29b37d6ae550e528","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}